{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Hacker!<br>Net.Attack() is a bullet-heaven roguelite where you visually program your own attack algorithms using 150+ drag-and-drop nodes, then watch them execute in real-time combat against security system hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.webp?t=1764603125\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devastating attack algorithms using drag-and-drop programming nodes. Chain triggers, branch conditionals, and loop executions to create thousands of unique combinations. Your custom code unleashes bullet-heaven chaos automatically. You focus on strategy and survival while your algorithms execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.webm?t=1764603125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain nodes to spawn projectiles that multiply on impact. Let the enemies shooting at each other or loop execution to create sustained area-of-effect devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.webp?t=1764603125\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into hostile systems across multiple regions in a near-future cyberwar. Each region presents unique security protocols and escalating difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" width=1004 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.webm?t=1764603125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of security countermeasures in fast-paced bullet-heaven combat. Your custom-coded algorithms execute automatically based on the logic <strong>you engineer</strong>, unleashing storms of projectiles while you navigate the chaos. Each run pushes your builds to their breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.webp?t=1764603125\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Hacker Ranking Points (HRP) by completing difficulty levels for the first time with any operative. Your HRP unlocks new hacker operatives, regions and more .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple hacker characters, each with unique abilities and programming specializations. Find your playstyle and engineer your path to dominance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shit Happens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/6dbcc53ebef1f6bdd210160314f890b3747f3840.jpg"},{"name":"Now You\u2019re on the Right Track","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/6bcb0ffdb9479c55e4e1532172f4738714baee4a.jpg"},{"name":"Adaptable Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/872b34c067c6c397643b47f63ba3b8f7e7779d80.jpg"},{"name":"Let\u2019s Get Out of Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/01dd4a2d082233f559a4905b5c1f1e5ced95ccc5.jpg"},{"name":"God Mode Admin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/e04f9b573dc6fe7ce587ca97f8aa75b0951e126e.jpg"},{"name":"Amazing Grace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/1317e060492331c44afefeef27102257e9d7f00a.jpg"},{"name":"Z13 Can Use This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/7b67fcf49c76b5d06043d58d1e06eaac2a7ffd9f.jpg"},{"name":"The Public Will Know","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/5fea6f7fbe970eba8b9917b03aa349d362ae7d7e.jpg"},{"name":"Now Back to Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/f7c8703175dcff3cd8c91c24f7d2c0888c5b1c27.jpg"},{"name":"Grandma Relies on COBOL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047370/67df1e2759d608d83c955ee91f8eb66bae579d40.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047370?t=1764603125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047370?t=1764603125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/c1e2d0f4cc6cc23af9da539a23e0eeba5d064572/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764603125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/c1e2d0f4cc6cc23af9da539a23e0eeba5d064572/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764603125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Is this Game something for you?</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Programming Nodes</strong> - Build unlimited algorithmic combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Hacker Characters</strong> - Unique abilities and specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Regions</strong> - Hack your way through areas with increasing security</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes </strong>- Progess through levels, experiment in sandbox mode, or try yourself in daily challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacker Ranking Progression</strong> - Unlock content through skill mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Market Upgrades</strong> - Spend extracted Files on permanent power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-Heaven Combat</strong> - Your code unleashes overwhelming firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No RNG Excuses</strong>\u00a0- Deterministic challenge where logic and skill beats luck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Programming</strong> - Accessible to beginners, infinite depth for masters</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Hacker!<br>Net.Attack() is a bullet-heaven roguelite where you visually program your own attack algorithms using 150+ drag-and-drop nodes, then watch them execute in real-time combat against security system hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.webp?t=1764603125\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/f9156862e8b8022738c59c71ae392c8a.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devastating attack algorithms using drag-and-drop programming nodes. Chain triggers, branch conditionals, and loop executions to create thousands of unique combinations. Your custom code unleashes bullet-heaven chaos automatically. You focus on strategy and survival while your algorithms execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/afe293fd72380cfcc8198623de5f26c5.webm?t=1764603125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain nodes to spawn projectiles that multiply on impact. Let the enemies shooting at each other or loop execution to create sustained area-of-effect devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.webp?t=1764603125\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/cfe7e9b1316cd21987d7678b43e97f73.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into hostile systems across multiple regions in a near-future cyberwar. Each region presents unique security protocols and escalating difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" width=1004 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/48957113bc67964b91238d0a231d24a7.webm?t=1764603125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of security countermeasures in fast-paced bullet-heaven combat. Your custom-coded algorithms execute automatically based on the logic <strong>you engineer</strong>, unleashing storms of projectiles while you navigate the chaos. Each run pushes your builds to their breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.webp?t=1764603125\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047370/extras/d4ab07625bf55c2dff57d1c16a8523dc.poster.avif?t=1764603125\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Hacker Ranking Points (HRP) by completing difficulty levels for the first time with any operative. Your HRP unlocks new hacker operatives, regions and more .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple hacker characters, each with unique abilities and programming specializations. Find your playstyle and engineer your path to dominance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["ByteRockers' Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea